---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About us | Eco Tech Group"
  description="Meet Eco Tech Group, an importer, distributor and stockholder of steel pipes and steel structures serving Poland and the EU."
>
  <PageHero title="About us" />
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24">
    <div class="grid items-start gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-x-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-normal leading-snug text-ink md:text-2xl">
          Sales and distribution of
          <br />
          <strong class="font-semibold">steel pipes</strong>
        </h2>
        <div class="mt-6 h-px w-36 bg-ink/10"></div>
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 text-base leading-7 text-ink/75">
          <p>
            EcoTech is an experienced team that has delivered dependable
            solutions for the changing needs of the steel market for more than
            14 years.
          </p>
          <p>
            By responding to our customers' needs and developing long-term
            partnerships, we have become both a direct importer and distributor
            and one of Poland's leading steel-pipe stockholders.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <img
        src="/img/main/o--firmie-1.webp"
        alt="Eco Tech Group team with steel pipes"
        width="840"
        height="480"
        class="h-auto w-full"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <img
        src="/img/main/o-firmie-2.webp"
        alt="Steel pipes of various diameters in a storage yard"
        width="767"
        height="480"
        class="h-auto w-full"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <div class="space-y-5 text-base leading-7 text-ink/75">
        <p>
          We serve construction, civil engineering, hydraulic engineering,
          chemical, mining, automotive and energy businesses throughout Poland
          and the European Union. Our market knowledge enables us to source
          products precisely matched to a required grade and application.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our customers include both end users of steel pipes and other
          steel-product distributors. Our team provides practical technical
          advice on pipe types, grades and uses.
        </p>
        <p class="font-semibold text-ink">
          Over the years, we have earned a reputation as a dependable, trusted
          partner.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-normal leading-snug text-ink md:text-2xl">
          Fabrication and installation of
          <br />
          <strong class="font-semibold">steel structures</strong>
        </h2>
        <div class="mt-6 h-px w-36 bg-ink/10"></div>
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 text-base leading-7 text-ink/75">
          <p>
            EcoTech is a growing company and a reliable partner. Through close
            cooperation with manufacturers and the trust of our customers, we
            maintain stocks exceeding 8,000 tonnes of steel pipes.
          </p>
          <p>
            Our experience and continuously expanding capabilities allow us to
            offer competitive prices and attractive delivery terms.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <img
        src="/img/main/o-firmie-3.webp"
        alt="Steel pipes and structures in an industrial facility"
        width="840"
        height="480"
        class="h-auto w-full"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
    <blockquote class="mt-6 border-l-4 border-ink/10 px-5 py-4 text-base leading-7 text-ink/75">
      <p>
        “Connecting for generations” is the principle shared by everyone at
        EcoTech. We are a family-oriented company, so relationships — with
        customers, suppliers and within our team — matter most. By nurturing
        them, we have built a strong position in little more than a decade and
        continue to strengthen it with our partners.
      </p>
    </blockquote>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
